Z||000009||stimpy||06-19-2000||07:59 PM||||Monkey, I realize how difficult it is to stand up and be accountable. I sympathize with your issues and accept your apology. Like I said, I wasn't mad at you, just kinda saddened. You are respected. Peace.||||reg||1
